---
title: "State Machine - Visit Lifecycle"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft : bidan membuka form

  Draft --> Saved : submit form valid / save_patients()
  Draft --> Draft : edit field belum submit
  Draft --> Cancelled : tombol Batal / discard

  Saved --> Updated : edit existing visit / _deep_merge dan save
  Updated --> Updated : edit tambahan / save berulang
  Updated --> Saved : tidak ada perubahan baru
  Saved --> Archived : hapus catatan (admin) / DELETE
  Updated --> Archived : hapus catatan (admin) / DELETE
  Archived --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]

  state Draft {
    [*] --> Empty
    Empty --> Filling : input nama
    Filling --> Validating : klik Simpan
    Validating --> Filling : validasi gagal (B03)
    Validating --> [*] : validasi OK
  }

  note right of Saved
    LEGENDA NOTASI STATE MACHINE
    --
    [*] -> S : initial transition ke state S
    S -> [*] : transisi ke final state
    label transisi : trigger [guard] / action
    state S { ... } : komposisi state (nested)
    Self-loop S -> S : event yang tidak ubah state utama
    State Saved adalah hasil sukses POST patient (201).
    State Updated adalah hasil sukses PUT patient (200).
    State Archived adalah hasil DELETE patient (204, admin only).
    Sumber kode api/routes/patient_routes.py POST/PUT/DELETE.
  end note
